Date: Wed, 23 Sep 2026 08:31:06 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 40/58] topk: Python reader for the exact-restart counters

Reads persistent_topk_exact_counters into {slot: value}, logs one line on a
cadence, and degrades to a one-time warning when the op is absent.
