 vllm/envs.py                                  |  12 ++
 .../qwen4_exp/nvidia/ops/topk_counters.py     | 167 ++++++++++++++++++
 vllm/v1/worker/gpu/model_runner.py            |  13 ++
 4 files changed, 252 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 vllm/models/qwen4_exp/nvidia/ops/topk_counters.py

